    "turn_idx": 79,
    "turn_text": "Is it ever? So in this hour, okay, it's going to go a little chippy. It's going to be a little silly, but we're going to talk about some grown up stuff. What we do on this show is we very much put your vitamins and your applesauce. So you don't feel yourself digesting all the hard news I've got to share with you during the course of the day. That's the hook of this show. You know, we're going through the grown up stuff, you know, running our news errands. We're just stopping for a couple of tequila shots along with it. It's like, you know, you know, those people who go holiday shopping and hit a bar in between stores. That's pretty much what this show is. Fact,",
