    "turn_text": "All you have to do is look at the numbers. In December, it's over 300,000 encounters. And that's larger than the city of White Pittsburgh. And that's just one month. We have to address that and come up with a solution. And we can't be a piecemeal or any kind of here in the, you know, we have to step up and deliver a comprehensive border security issue. I admire your honesty.",
