    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/3/93514.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 129,
    "turn_text": "Listen, man, I love you for calling out the Republican Party because it's really is my belief from doing this show and talking to enough people that there's just so much posturing in our politics now and so much of what you deal with in Washington really looks like a uni party where it's more expedient to go along to get along than it is to care about the country. I mean, do you feel that way? Walk it around DC?",
