        "text": "The speaker trusts their experience on the show and conversations with others as valid evidence of broader political trends.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener shares a similar perception of political dysfunction in Washington.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Political expediency outweighs moral responsibility in contemporary governance.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The term 'uni party' refers to functional unity despite formal bipartisanship.",
        "confidence": 0.83
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
  {
