    "turn_text": "Now the coffee's bad. You don't understand. You stop drinking coffee, no more storms, not change the weather. Mother nature, not a coffee gal. Excuse me, it's birthing person nature. I don't want to assume anyone's pronouns here. But this is the fraud of what you're dealing with. They fly out there and they come up with these sweeping declarations of how they're going to save the world this time. Don't get me wrong, none of us are going to follow any of this, but you guys are going to follow this because that's how we're going to save the world. And they're making money off of it. Okay, and they tie it to causes like coffee. Okay, because they need to get your attention because no one takes them seriously. No one takes the climate movement seriously. Like if you were to poll people, there are folks out there that are like, yeah, the climate's changing. They'd tell you that because the weather's always changing. Duh! Okay, but the movement has had three different titles. Okay, if you're on your third title, it's because your original movement was a fraud. Guys, it started off as we're all gonna freeze. These same people. who are telling you, okay, climate's changing, out of control, no more coffee. These people, this is their movement. It started as, we're all gonna freeze. We got 10 years, we're all gonna freeze. They were wrong. All right, wait a second, chances, I get it. Lord knows Jenny's let me back in the house a few times, gonna have a few second chances. Change the lock, but then she feels bad, gives you the K. They're like, look at him out there, Lincoln, he's so chubby on the lawn. Anyway, okay, second chance, 10 years, we're all gonna freeze, you're all gonna die. All right, fine, okay, we are red-faced about this. But in the next 10 years, we're all gonna melt! All right, gee, oh, okay, well, let's see, you know. Bible does preach forgiveness. I'll tell you what we're going to do. Let's take another 10-year crack at it. The weather's just changing, guys. It's just changing. And it is. They're not wrong about this one. That's what weather does. It changes. Okay? What doesn't change is the grift. Okay, they are using the weather to horrify gullible people into giving the money. That fear that manufactured hysteria allows them to usurp your rights in the name of an emergency. You know how they did that with COVID? I can't go to church. Can't go to work. I mean, if you want to riot. on behalf of a junkie who shouldn't have been killed by the cops, but was, okay, yeah, you can go riots. The virus knows it's sophisticated. We made it in the Chinese lab. It supports social justice causes. But the point is, when it comes to the climate, it is that same thing. It's the weaponization of an emergency to take away your freedoms and give them more power. And when someone tells you, coffee is causing climate change, do you know what you're supposed to tell them? You're supposed to tell them, You. That's what you're supposed to tell them. Okay, because every one of these people is a circus clown straight up.",
